[section DOCUMENTATION]
The repository-local [file doc/tcl/config-parameters.tcl] owns the parameter reference.
[const {make regen-config-parameters-includes}] regenerates its committed fragment.
[const {make check-doc}] checks freshness and validates this manual.
[const {make build-doc}] produces standalone HTML and nroff documentation.
The same fragment and manual can be staged into the combined NaviServer documentation
without making ordinary NaviServer builds depend on this repository.
